  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Four circled symbols, one plus followed by three minus signs (⊕⊖⊖⊖), the GRADE notation for very low quality of evidence.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "أربعة رموز داخل دوائر، رمز زائد يليه ثلاثة رموز ناقص (⊕⊖⊖⊖)، وهي رموز منهجية GRADE للدلالة على جودة بيّنات منخفضة جداً.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "四个带圈符号，一个加号后接三个减号（⊕⊖⊖⊖），为GRADE方法中表示证据质量极低的标记。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuatro símbolos en círculos, un signo más seguido de tres signos menos (⊕⊖⊖⊖), la notación GRADE de calidad de la evidencia muy baja.",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quatre symboles cerclés, un signe plus suivi de trois signes moins (⊕⊖⊖⊖), notation GRADE d'une qualité des données très faible.",
      "lang": "fr",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Четыре символа в кружках: один плюс и три минуса (⊕⊖⊖⊖) — обозначение GRADE для очень низкого качества доказательств.",
      "lang": "ru",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
